Ya? Kau merindukanku?

1007
01:37:08,692 --> 01:37:10,259
Wah!

1008
01:37:10,433 --> 01:37:12,783
Hai! Ya, aku san--

1009
01:37:12,957 --> 01:37:17,092
Aku sangat senang
bertemu denganmu juga, sobat!

1010
01:37:17,266 --> 01:37:19,007
Oke.

1011
01:37:19,181 --> 01:37:21,226
Oke. Aduh. Krypto!

1012
01:37:21,705 --> 01:37:23,968
Kau akan membuatku sakit mata,
Bung. Berhenti, berhenti, berhenti.

1013
01:37:37,242 --> 01:37:38,243
Oh, Krypto.

1014
01:37:38,983 --> 01:37:40,115
Oh.

1015
01:37:40,767 --> 01:37:42,769
- Oh, anak baik.
- Krypto, ayolah.

1016
01:37:49,776 --> 01:37:51,517
Kita harus pergi,
tapi kau...

1017
01:37:53,258 --> 01:37:54,477
Kau baik-baik saja. Kan?

1018
01:37:55,739 --> 01:37:56,958
Ya.

1019
01:37:57,567 --> 01:37:59,699
Aku akan tinggal
dengan bibiku dan...

1020
01:38:01,266 --> 01:38:03,138
Aku mungkin akan mulai membuat pedang,
seperti ayahku.

1021
01:38:04,443 --> 01:38:05,618
Itu ide bagus.

1022
01:38:11,407 --> 01:38:13,975
Jadi, apakah kau akan kembali
ke tur minummu?

1023
01:38:14,149 --> 01:38:15,280
Tanpa penilaian.

1024
01:38:15,454 --> 01:38:16,847
Um...

1025
01:38:17,021 --> 01:38:19,632
Tidak, kupikir hari-hari tur minumku
sudah berlalu.

1026
01:38:27,553 --> 01:38:29,207
Aku sangat senang
bertemu denganmu, Ruthye.

1027
01:38:31,079 --> 01:38:32,210
Ya, aku juga.

1028
01:38:39,652 --> 01:38:41,219
Jadi, aku...

1029
01:38:43,265 --> 01:38:44,919
kurang ini selamat tinggal.

1030
01:38:46,355 --> 01:38:47,834
Selamat tinggal, Kara.

1031
01:38:50,794 --> 01:38:53,710
Ayo, Krypto.

1032
01:39:01,326 --> 01:39:02,893
Aku akan menyesali ini. Um...

1033
01:39:06,201 --> 01:39:07,506
Aku belum selesai merayakan
ulang tahunku.

1034
01:39:07,680 --> 01:39:08,899
Ya!

1035
01:39:09,073 --> 01:39:10,422
Ya, tentu saja!

1036
01:39:11,206 --> 01:39:12,685
Terima kasih, terima kasih,
terima kasih!

1037
01:39:12,859 --> 01:39:14,035
Jangan berterima kasih dulu.
Kau yang traktir, kan?

1038
01:39:18,517 --> 01:39:19,910
Ayo.

1039
01:39:20,084 --> 01:39:21,956
Kau bisa pergi
beberapa hari, kan?

1040
01:39:22,130 --> 01:39:23,783
Bibimu tidak akan panik?

1041
01:39:23,958 --> 01:39:25,307
Dia tidak akan panik.

1042
01:39:42,628 --> 01:39:44,804
- Hai.
- Hai.

1043
01:39:49,070 --> 01:39:49,984
Perjalanan berat?

1044
01:39:52,856 --> 01:39:53,857
Ya.

1045
